# Line endings are LF in the repository and in every checkout, on Windows too (D-251), whatever a machine's
# core.autocrlf says. Tests read some files byte for byte (the Kiro steering files' front matter, KDEV-01), and the
# recording rig's shell scripts run inside Linux containers, where a CRLF line breaks bash.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched as text.
*.sqlite binary
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
